---
/**
 * Vendor embed zone.
 *
 * This component is rendered once, right before </body>, on every page.
 * It's the designated spot for pasting a third-party vendor's install
 * snippet (chatbot widgets, live chat, popups, analytics, etc.) so it
 * can be tested end-to-end against this sandbox site.
 *
 * To test a vendor:
 *   1. Paste their <script> install snippet in the block below.
 *   2. Run `npm run dev` and confirm the widget loads/behaves as expected.
 *   3. Remove or comment it out when you're done, so the next person
 *      starts from a clean testbed.
 *
 * Most chat widgets self-position with `position: fixed` and don't need
 * a mount element, but #vendor-embed-target is here for the ones that do.
 */
---

<div id="vendor-embed-target"></div>

<!-- ============================================================ -->
<!-- VENDOR EMBED START — paste one vendor's snippet below         -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->

